# The linewidth factor turns the gain change during a pulse into a frequency shift, which detunes a firing pillar from its dark neighbour: a larger factor slows the pulse and finally stops it.
# Reference: the same network integrated independently (complex arithmetic, LSODA).
title Chain of 8 with linewidth factor 0
laser alpha=0
sites 8
path 1 8 kappa=0.06
kick 1 amplitude=2
run 3000
